Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.90,0:02:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白鐘小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偵探
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海神研究所
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和它所進行的伊卡路斯計劃一同沉入大海了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使死 也要保護产品的機密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 所謂自爆裝置...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.50,0:02:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有高温反應
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:33.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有炸彈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是爆炸 這不是自爆反應
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.30,0:02:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什么東西要启動了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是自爆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:02:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等著我  沙羅  戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:36.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好戲要上演了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最終話 想三人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:41.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易  好不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再想過去的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全軍聽令
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始全面攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:06:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了  已經够了  戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:05.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎你不是還有雙樹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.70,0:06:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  請把我...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.20,0:06:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你少廢話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算没有我 也不是很好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算没有我...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.80,0:06:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎不是還有雙樹嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以  去和雙樹...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.40,0:06:37.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去珍惜雙樹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再管我了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...少...廢... 話
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:56.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么 就算没有我 去珍惜雙樹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少給我開這種玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.60,0:07:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你給我聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说的是真心話
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没什么錢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也没有權勢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.70,0:07:14.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和雙樹  兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是兩個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是三個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想三個人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.70,0:08:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三個人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎  沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:14.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙樹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.30,0:08:30.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙羅  雙樹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:35.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收拾了這傢伙之後 三個人一起回去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.90,0:08:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放棄無謂的抵抗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃我這招
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偵探飛脚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近  我一直做著同一個夢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一個荒唐透頂的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像什么父親包辦的婚姻之類
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:58.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密基地啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:09:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有什么烏賊怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,復葉機
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據常理去解釋真的會很累
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 即使這樣也遇見了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要用一句話解釋的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么樣  醒了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.20,0:10:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒了 我醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  你謀殺啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.40,0:10:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.80,0:10:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我都说了都交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:43.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我不就没事可做了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不用干 還是坐著比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好過分 好過分 好過分…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從那以後  三個星期過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德國的事件和雙子魂川市的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.80,0:11:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知怎的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在同一時間得到了解决
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:25.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這個世界上
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多我們所不知的方面和系統存在吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了  愛之助
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:11:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話说回來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不乘航空公司的飛機來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好煩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.70,0:12:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎么说好呢 是一時衝動還是别的什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在德語裡  辯護律師該怎么讀啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:24.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没什么理由繼續關著他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  你們到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您還是不要深究了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是为了您的性命也好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:51.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知是被哪國的什么人的意志所支配
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.70,0:12:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界始終旋轉不息
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:58.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,净是些我們這些凡人所無法知曉的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.00,0:13:03.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上是下午的日程安排
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.80,0:13:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,13點開始是和反對者的决定性談判
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:13.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我方有足够的優勢可以迅速結束談判
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:15.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成以後在會場
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以再往下壓三個價位
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會長
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玩扔球
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:38.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:48.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 即使如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.90,0:13:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們只能對我們所能瞭解的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.40,0:14:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對一個擺在眼前 被稱作是人生的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.10,0:14:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像一個傻瓜似的 全力以赴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.30,0:14:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也只能做到這些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想  這樣也挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要成为一個像你父親那樣可靠的男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.90,0:15:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總是有旁人這么對我说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.40,0:17:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的頭髮好奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不許摸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.00,0:17:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么  走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙葉先生   白鐘小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:17:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 時間差不多了 我們開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.50,0:18:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了同甘共苦的友誼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿姨 你好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.60,0:18:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿玄 好帥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.60,0:18:29.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界第一
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.60,0:18:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是完美的一對
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么下一項  請致祝辭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:44.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有請親友代表 雙葉戀太郎先生  拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:53.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二代
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雙葉先生  加油
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么没聽说過
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.10,0:19:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  快點去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀太郎   加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.20,0:19:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快樂嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.70,0:19:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近  我一直做著同一個夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是一個荒唐透頂的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:24.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像什么父親包辦的婚姻之類的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.30,0:20:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:28.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有什么烏賊怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:29.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,復葉機
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.90,0:20:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據常理去解釋真的會很累
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 即使這樣也遇見了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:38.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要用一句話解釋的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大概就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.40,0:21:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那大概就是...有關愛的故事吧
